					"height": 161,
					"text": "Get field info ( numTable ; numField ; relTable ; relFld ; props ; choiceList )\r      with:\r         numTable (Integer): Table number \t\r         numField (Integer):  Field number \t\r         relTable (Integer):    Related table \t\r         relFld (Integer):        Related field \t\r         props (Longint):       Field properties \t\r         choiceList  (String): Choice list"
